@startuml 01-checkout-data-flow-analysis
!theme plain
title Stripe Checkout Data Flow Analysis - Where is OXPAID Set?
footer Sprint 10 - 2025-12-05

skinparam {
    BackgroundColor white
    ArrowColor #333333
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFACD
    NoteBorderColor #DAA520
}

' Color Legend
legend right
|= Color |= Meaning |
|<#90EE90> | Frontend Flow (User Return) |
|<#87CEEB> | Webhook Flow (Stripe Server) |
|<#FFB6C1> | OXPAID Update Location |
|<#FFA500> | Problem Area |
|<#DDA0DD> | Contract State Transition |
endlegend

participant "Customer\nBrowser" as Customer #LightGreen
participant "StripeOrderController\nrender()" as OrderCtrl #90EE90
participant "CheckoutOrchestrator\ninitiatePayment()" as Orchestrator #90EE90
participant "StripeCheckoutReturnHandler\nhandle()" as ReturnHandler #90EE90
participant "PaymentAuthorizedHandler\nhandle()" as AuthHandler #90EE90
participant "StripeOrderCreationHandler\nhandle()" as CreateOrderHandler #90EE90
participant "OxidShopOrderService\ncreateOrder()" as ShopOrderSvc #90EE90
participant "Stripe\nWebhook" as Webhook #87CEEB
participant "WebhookController\nrender()" as WebhookCtrl #87CEEB
participant "WebhookProcessingService" as WebhookSvc #87CEEB
participant "WebhookContractFulfillmentHandler" as FulfillHandler #87CEEB
database "osc_payment_contract" as ContractDB #DDA0DD
database "oxorder" as OrderDB #FFB6C1

== FRONTEND FLOW (User Returns from Stripe) ==

Customer -> OrderCtrl: Return from Stripe\n?session_id=cs_xxx&contract_token=xxx
activate OrderCtrl #90EE90

OrderCtrl -> Orchestrator: processCheckoutReturn()
activate Orchestrator #90EE90

Orchestrator -> ReturnHandler: dispatch(StripeCheckoutReturnEvent)
activate ReturnHandler #90EE90

ReturnHandler -> ReturnHandler: 1. Validate session_id
ReturnHandler -> ReturnHandler: 2. Validate contract_token
ReturnHandler -> ReturnHandler: 3. Retrieve Stripe Session
ReturnHandler -> ReturnHandler: 4. Verify payment_status = 'paid'

note right of ReturnHandler #FFA500
**CRITICAL BUG FIX (Sprint 7)**
providerOrderId must be pi_xxx
NOT cs_xxx (checkout session ID)
end note

ReturnHandler -> AuthHandler: dispatch(PaymentAuthorizedEvent)\nproviderOrderId = **pi_xxx**
deactivate ReturnHandler
activate AuthHandler #90EE90

AuthHandler -> ContractDB: contract.transitionToPending()
AuthHandler -> ContractDB: contract.fulfillCondition('payment_authorized')
AuthHandler -> ContractDB: contract.setProvider('stripe', pi_xxx)

note over ContractDB #DDA0DD
Contract State:
DRAFT → PENDING → READY_TO_COMMIT
end note

AuthHandler -> CreateOrderHandler: dispatch(ContractReadyToCommitEvent)
deactivate AuthHandler
activate CreateOrderHandler #90EE90

CreateOrderHandler -> ShopOrderSvc: createOrder(request)
activate ShopOrderSvc #90EE90

ShopOrderSvc -> OrderDB: Order::finalizeOrder()
note right of OrderDB #FFB6C1
**OXPAID = '0000-00-00 00:00:00'**
Order created but NOT marked paid!
end note

ShopOrderSvc --> CreateOrderHandler: OrderResponse(orderId)
deactivate ShopOrderSvc

CreateOrderHandler -> ContractDB: contract.commitToOrder(orderId)
note over ContractDB #DDA0DD
Contract State:
READY_TO_COMMIT → COMMITTED
end note

CreateOrderHandler --> OrderCtrl: Return to thankyou page
deactivate CreateOrderHandler
deactivate Orchestrator
deactivate OrderCtrl

== WEBHOOK FLOW (Stripe Server Calls) ==

Webhook -> WebhookCtrl: POST /stripe/webhook\npayment_intent.succeeded\npi_xxx
activate WebhookCtrl #87CEEB

WebhookCtrl -> WebhookSvc: processEvent()
activate WebhookSvc #87CEEB

WebhookSvc -> FulfillHandler: handlePaymentSucceeded(pi_xxx)
activate FulfillHandler #87CEEB

FulfillHandler -> ContractDB: findByProviderOrderId(pi_xxx)

note right of ContractDB #FFA500
**IF CONTRACT NOT FOUND (pi_xxx)**
Falls back to legacy processing
end note

FulfillHandler -> ContractDB: contract.fulfill()
note over ContractDB #DDA0DD
Contract State:
COMMITTED → FULFILLED
end note

FulfillHandler --> WebhookSvc: true (fulfilled)
deactivate FulfillHandler

WebhookSvc -> WebhookSvc: updateOrderFieldsAfterContractFulfillment(pi_xxx)
WebhookSvc -> OrderDB: **UPDATE oxorder SET OXPAID = NOW()**
note right of OrderDB #FFB6C1
**OXPAID FINALLY SET HERE!**
Only via webhook, not frontend flow
end note

WebhookSvc --> WebhookCtrl: 200 OK
deactivate WebhookSvc
deactivate WebhookCtrl

== TIMING ANALYSIS ==

note across #FFFACD
**RACE CONDITION POTENTIAL**

Timeline:
1. User clicks "Pay" → Contract DRAFT
2. User completes Stripe payment
3. User returns to shop → Contract COMMITTED, Order created (OXPAID=0)
4. Stripe sends webhook (may be delayed 1-60 seconds)
5. Webhook updates OXPAID

**Problem:** If webhook fails/delayed, OXPAID stays '0000-00-00 00:00:00'
**Problem:** If user refreshes before webhook, they see unpaid order
end note

@enduml
